®A young woman craving acceptance and love, endures both mental and physical fights and trials for love. Fighting for her man, her family and happiness, while her mother in-law, also fights, just as hard, to replace her with her preferred choice for her son. Her mother in-law stops at nothing to make her life miserable, in hopes to get rid of her, by any means necessary! An urban book about a young woman's struiggles in her life and then marriage. The book includes epic beatings, rapings, torment, intense love, extreme hate. All after saying I do!"¡
æThe Sexual Healing Guide: Adult Edition
With more than 40 years' experience and research, Casanova Da Vinci's most eagerly awaited second novel is now ready to be released. With constructive Advice, Know How, How To..., and a vast quantity of Valued Knowledge, the Guide shows the Reader 'Key Stones', 'Precursors', 'Variables' and 'POV's' that will not be found in any other Reference Book or Novel.
Based on 'One of a Kind' information, Casanova Da Vinci looks into 'Attraction', how to 'Attract' those you wish to see you, and construct a fully workable course of progression into 'First Contact'. From 'Breaking The Ice', to 'Getting your coat and leaving - with the Woman', the course Reconstructs and Presents the Reader with the necessary Steps to fulfil their wishes or goal(s).
From the 'Back at her place' stage, Casanova Da Vinci takes a detailed look into 'Sexual Intercourse', the places in which we carry these physical positions out, and also, what comes from deciding whether or not to Begin a Relationship or choose to have it as a 'One-Off', 'Casual', 'One Night Stand', or be as Confident as you like for it to become a 'Lasting Relationship'.
Taking every caution to put to paper the advantages of 'Attraction', 'Compassion' and 'Trust', it is within the channels of 'Marriage' and 'Divorce', that Casanova Da Vinci brings Secrets and Methods in which to reverse - not all cases - of two people 'Breaking Up', 'Splitting', or ultimately calling it a day and 'Divorcing', while giving them a chance to 'Repair', 'Heal', 'Fix' their 'Marriage'.
Going back to the simple Basics, the Reader will see first-hand a 'Guide' that is essential to anyone who is needing information on how to overcome many of life's obstacles; starting with setting up a new house to become a home, dealing with the surroundings of your new habitat, knowing the rules that apply to everyone, and making the foundations for the arrival of 'Love'...
If you have never had a "Relationship" (physical or otherwise) then you will have the advantage; as all techniques change through each new generation, which is why there are two sections that will accompany those Prefixes. Told from multi-angled view, also giving reference for the Woman, too, it is the Test of the water and following of The Guide that is to bring together two people who would otherwise be complete strangers - and carry on being as such - if it wasn't for "The Sexual Healing Guide: Adult Edition".
As well as 'Relationship Building', Casanova brings to the foreground 'Separation' and 'Divorce', something that many of us hate or loathe hearing about, let alone being in the middle of it. Here the emphasis is on 'Repair', and if you know that it cannot be 'Fixed', then why not read this section?
Using techniques that were lost or forgotten, Casanova Da Vinci looks into 'Re-Lighting the Spark' and 'Rebuilding' the broken Marriage to a whole new height, whether in the 'Marriage' itself, or in the 'Sexual Pleasure' that can be learned and acted out. Even for those who are 'Off the Horse'; an English phrase that means you are down from a 'Relationship', but you're not out of 'The Race'.
You will find useful, valuable and sometimes treasurable information throughout "The Sexual Healing Guide: Adult Edition", as well as visually experience some of the more 'Erotic Examples'. And by opening up to people as a collective audience, maturity and understanding of each others needs, their solutions and executions should be sought and become successful."—
ŒIn the final installment of Beyond the Spiderwick Chronicles, Nick and Laurie had thought they solved their giant problems when they drove all the giants into the sea. But now, the Grace kids have come back to tell them they may have more trouble coming their way!
It turns out the giants control the population of Hydra, a dragon like creature that is creating sinkholes all over Florida. But with the mermaids refusing to return the giants to the shore, the nixie's still missing and the threat of a destroyed Florida drawing closer, the kids have to take matters in their own hands.
Will Nick and Laurie be able to stop the destruction they unwittingly caused? Can a new giant hunter help save the day? Can Arthur Spiderwick's Field Guide help them out of this or are they on their own?
Find out in the final conclusion of the Spiderwick saga!"˜
ÙBringing fresh wonders and dangers to light in the skies of Pern, Anne McCaffrey and her son, Todd, who demonstrated his writing talents in the bestselling novels Dragon's Kin and Dragonsblood, return with their second collaboration: a thrilling adventure of discovery and fate.
Pellar is an orphan taken in by Masterharper Zist. Though born mute, Pellar is a gifted tracker, and when Zist sets off to take over as harper for Natalon's coal-mining camp, Pellar-along with his fire-lizard, Chitter-joins him on a secret mission of his own: to find out if reported thefts of coal are the work of the Shunned, criminals condemned to a life of wandering and hardship.
Halla is one of the children of the Shunned. Though innocent of their parents' crimes, these children have inherited their cruel punishment. Lack of food, shelter, and clothes is their lot; hope is unknown to them. And what future would they hope for? Without a hold to call their own, there will be no protection for them when the lethal Thread inevitably falls again. Life is even tougher for Halla. Her family gone, she must fend for herself. Yet despite the brutality of her surroundings, Halla is kind and gentle, devoted to those more helpless than she.
As depraved as Halla is good, Tenim is in league with Tarik, a crooked miner from Camp Natalon, who helps him steal coal in exchange for a cut of the profit. But Tenim soon realizes there is a lot more to be made from firestone, the volatile mineral that enables the dragons of Pern to burn Thread out of the sky. Tenim doesn't care what he has to do, or whom he has to kill, in order to corner the market.
Cristov is Tarik's son. Dishonored by his father's greed and treachery, the boy must make amends somehow, even if it means risking his life by mining the volatile firestone, which detonates on contact with the slightest drop of moisture.
When the last remaining firestone mine explodes in flames, a desperate race begins to find a new deposit of the deadly but essential mineral, for without it there can be no defense against Thread. But Tenim has a murderous plan to turn tragedy to his own advantage, and only Pellar, Halla, and Cristov can stop him-and ensure that there will be a future for all on the world of the Dragonriders.
From the Hardcover edition."Å
˛
The river Thames is London's most important yet neglected artery. When a young woman is found chained to a post in the tide, no-one can understand how she came to be drowned there. At the Peculiar Crimes Unit, Arthur Bryant and John May find themselves dealing with an impossible crime committed in a very public place.
Soon they discover that the river is giving up other victims, but as the investigation extends from the coast of Libya to the nightclubs of North London, it proves as murkily sinister as the Thames itself. That's only part of the problem; Bryant's rapidly deteriorating condition prevents him from handling the case, and he is confined to home. To make matters worse, May makes a fatal error of judgement that knocks him out of action and places everyone at risk.
With the PCU staff baffled as much by their own detectives as the case, the only people who can help now are the battery of eccentrics Bryant keeps listed in his diary, but will their arcane knowledge save the day or make matters even worse? Soon there's a clear suspect in everyone's sights - the only thing that's missing is any scrap of evidence.
As the detectives' disastrous investigation comes unstuck, the whole team gets involved in some serious messing about on the river. In an adventure that's as twisting as the river upon which it's set, will there be anything left of the Peculiar Crimes Unit when it's over?"	)\è¬ı(
